12
00:00:13,086 --> 00:00:13,606
Cinco

13
00:00:14,086 --> 00:00:14,606
Cuatro

14
00:00:15,086 --> 00:00:15,606
Tres

15
00:00:16,085 --> 00:00:16,606
Dos

16
00:00:17,086 --> 00:00:17,606
Uno

17
00:00:18,854 --> 00:00:19,430
Respuesta:

18
00:00:19,719 --> 00:00:20,344
¡no son diez

19
00:00:20,356 --> 00:00:20,681
